1
00:04:08,571 --> 00:04:14,571
The game is played in the blink of an eye.

2
00:08:17,142 --> 00:08:23,142
Fastball is a documentary film directed by Jonathan Hock.

3
00:12:25,714 --> 00:12:31,714
Since 1912, baseball has been a game obsessed with statistics and speed.

4
00:16:34,285 --> 00:16:40,285
Thrown at upwards of 100 miles per hour, a fastball moves too quickly for
human cognition and accelerates into the realm of intuition.

5
00:20:42,857 --> 00:20:48,857
Fastball is a look at how the game at its highest levels of achievement transcends logic and
even skill, becoming the primal struggle for man to control the uncontrollable.

6
00:24:51,428 --> 00:24:57,428
Narrator, played by Kevin Costner.

7
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:06,000
Self (archive footage), played by Hank Aaron.

8
00:33:08,571 --> 00:33:14,571
Self (archive footage), played by Nolan Ryan.

9
00:37:17,142 --> 00:37:23,142
Self, played by Derek Jeter.

10
00:41:25,714 --> 00:41:31,714
Self, played by Denard Span.

11
00:45:34,285 --> 00:45:40,285
Self (archive footage), played by Craig Kimbrel.

12
00:49:42,857 --> 00:49:48,857
Fastball is an American rock band.

13
00:53:51,428 --> 00:53:57,428
It was formed in Austin, Texas, in 1992.

14
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
The band originally called themselves Magneto U.S.A., and changed
their name after signing with Hollywood Records.

15
01:02:08,571 --> 01:02:14,571
In 1998, their album All the Pain Money Can Buy reached platinum sales within six
months of its release, and stayed on the Billboard 200 chart for a year.

16
01:06:17,142 --> 01:06:23,142
Their songs "The Way" and "Out of My Head" reached No.

17
01:10:25,714 --> 01:10:31,714
14 on Billboard's Adult Alternative Songs chart, respectively.

18
01:14:34,285 --> 01:14:40,285
In addition, the group has been nominated for two Grammy Awards – Best Rock Performance by a Duo or Group
with Vocal for "The Way", and Best Long Form Music Video for their promotional video "The Way".

19
01:18:42,857 --> 01:18:48,857
They also received five The Austin Chronicle awards: 1998's Album of the Year, Best
Video, Best Single/EP, Band of the Year, and 1995's Best Pop Band.

20
01:22:51,428 --> 01:22:57,428
In late 2021, Fastball started a Patreon campaign supporting the release of new
music, as well as demos of their songs and the stories behind them.
